# Census output holds REAL money values — maximum amounts, example values and
# per-column distributions read from live customer and financial data. It must
# never enter git, for the same reason scripts/postgres-full-copy/ blocks its
# reports. Re-run the script to regenerate what you need.
census*.json
census*.log
*.log

# The synthetic fixture built by make_fixture.py. Regenerate in one command;
# never commit a .db from this directory, so a live file copied here by mistake
# cannot be committed either.
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
fixture*
